# Google's hand landmark model bundle, ~7.8 MB. Fetched on first run straight
# from Google's own URL, which is the authoritative copy - vendoring it here
# would only add a binary to clone and a second thing to keep current.
hand_landmarker.task

# Per-frame detection CSVs. Measurements of one session on one rig, written
# every run - they are evidence for a question being asked now, not state the
# repo has to carry, unlike homography.json or bin_offsets.json.
logs/
